[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7684.47, "timestamp": "02:08:04", "text": "呃，等等，这是个像素游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7688.229, "timestamp": "02:08:08", "text": "更深的剑。好的，我要安装这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7691.91, "timestamp": "02:08:11", "text": "它是7000万像素。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7694.55, "timestamp": "02:08:14", "text": "嗯，这看起来很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7699.589, "timestamp": "02:08:19", "text": "好的。 70MPP游戏，像素游戏。我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7703.91, "timestamp": "02:08:23", "text": "到时候我们会为此开播的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7705.99, "timestamp": "02:08:25", "text": "现在，你们有什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7708.629, "timestamp": "02:08:28", "text": "有什么像素游戏推荐吗？你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7715.51, "timestamp": "02:08:35", "text": "不是健康杀手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7723.669, "timestamp": "02:08:43", "text": "英雄与将军"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7726.629, "timestamp": "02:08:46", "text": "有影响力的。不断打断专家发言。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7729.589, "timestamp": "02:08:49", "text": "错过了这场比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7733.27, "timestamp": "02:08:53", "text": "不断打断专家发言。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7736.79, "timestamp": "02:08:56", "text": "健康就是一切。是的，我看过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7739.27, "timestamp": "02:08:59", "text": "把它改编成漫画之类的。漫画"}]